flowchart TD
    start([Verify current scoped feature]) --> testing[Run required tests and review against Definition and release Design]
%% @airflow-context testing
%% Verify only against the current approved Definition digest and release Design
%% digest. Record check names, results and evidence in `.air/index.md`. Feature
%% checks do not substitute for the release-level integration checks below.
%% @end-airflow-context
    testing --> featureChecksPassed{Feature checks passed?}
    featureChecksPassed -- No: diagnose findings --> diagnosis[Compare implementation and results with approved Design and acceptance criteria]
%% @airflow-context diagnosis
%% Compare concrete test/review evidence against the current approved Definition
%% and Design. Route an implementation defect to Implementation; a material
%% Definition change to Definition and impact analysis; a Design gap to Design.
%% If cause or impact is unclear, stop and report evidence rather than guessing.
%% @end-airflow-context
    diagnosis --> rootCause{Root cause identified?}
    rootCause -- Implementation defect or deviation --> implementation[["Implementation: implementation.mmd"]]
    implementation -- Rework complete: return --> testing
    rootCause -- Feature Definition changed --> definition[["Definition: definition.mmd"]]
    definition -- Revised and approved --> impact[Assess affected release artifacts]
    definition -- Deferred or rejected: re-scope release --> releasePlanning[["Release planning: release-planning.mmd"]]
    impact --> scopeImpact{Scope feature set or release goals changed?}
    scopeImpact -- Yes: reapprove scope --> releasePlanning[["Release planning: release-planning.mmd"]]
    releasePlanning -- Scope reapproved --> designForChangedDefinition[["Design: design.mmd"]]
    releasePlanning -- Release planning deferred --> releaseDeferred([Release deferred])
    releasePlanning -- Release cancelled --> releaseCancelled([Release cancelled])
    scopeImpact -- No --> designImpact{Integrated Design or acceptance mapping changed?}
    designImpact -- Yes: reapprove Design --> design[["Design: design.mmd"]]
    designImpact -- No: no upstream impact --> implementation
    designForChangedDefinition -- Integrated Design approved --> implementation
    design -- Release Design revised and approved: return --> implementation
    design -- Release deferred --> releaseDeferred
    design -- Release cancelled --> releaseCancelled
    rootCause -- Design gap or conflict --> design
    rootCause -- Unclear cause or external blocker --> blocked([Blocked: report findings and ask])
    featureChecksPassed -- Yes: feature criteria pass --> moreUnverified{Any scoped feature remains unverified?}
    moreUnverified -- Yes: select next unverified feature --> implementation
    moreUnverified -- No: run release-level checks --> releaseChecks[Run integration tests and release acceptance checks]
    releaseChecks --> releaseChecksPassed{Release checks pass?}
    releaseChecksPassed -- No: diagnose integration findings --> releaseDiagnosis[Compare release failures with scope, design and feature evidence]
    releaseDiagnosis --> releaseRootCause{Release root cause identified?}
    releaseRootCause -- Feature implementation defect --> implementation
    releaseRootCause -- Integrated design gap --> design
    releaseRootCause -- Unclear cause or external blocker --> blocked
    releaseChecksPassed -- Yes --> verificationComplete([Release verification complete])
%% @airflow-context releaseChecks
%% Run release integration and project acceptance checks only after every feature
%% in the approved scope is verified. Record results against current scope/Design
%% digests. A failure goes through release diagnosis; passing checks do not
%% authorize publication, which remains a human decision in Project.
%% @end-airflow-context

    classDef boundary fill:#126a52,color:#ffffff,stroke:#126a52
    classDef approval fill:#fff0e8,color:#633b2c,stroke:#c68162
    class start,verificationComplete,blocked,releaseDeferred,releaseCancelled boundary
    class featureChecksPassed,rootCause,moreUnverified,releaseChecksPassed,releaseRootCause approval

%% @airflow-context rootCause
%% Route implementation defects or deviations back to Implementation.
%% If the approved feature Definition has materially changed, return through
%% Definition, then reapprove the affected release scope and integrated Design.
%% Route an incomplete or conflicting design to Design; its approval gate still
%% applies before implementation resumes. If evidence is insufficient or the
%% cause is external, stop at Blocked and report the evidence instead of guessing.
%% @end-airflow-context